#: freestringsunit.rs_resistance_fungleib_note_p5
msgctxt "freestringsunit.rs_resistance_fungleib_note_p5"
msgid ""
"5.Standart deviation of database for typical resistance Fung-Leibman's method:\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"|        Parameters           |      Limitations     |\n"
"|-----------------------------+----------------------|\n"
"| Length/Breadth,       Lwl/B |  2.520 to 17.935     |\n"
"| Breadth/Draft,          B/T |  1.696 to 10.204     |\n"
"| Prismatic coefficient,   Cp |  0.526 to 0.774      |\n"
"| Midship coefficient,     Cm |  0.556 to 0.994      |\n"
"| Waterplane coefficient, Cwp |  0.662 to 0.841      |\n"
"| Half entrance angle,     ie |    2.6 to 31.73 degr |\n"
"| Transom area coefficient Ta |   0.00 to 0.74       |\n"
"| Transom beam coefficient Tw |   0.00 to 1.00       |\n"
"| Disp/length, DLR=V/Lwl^3    |  16.24 to 359.2      |\n"
"| Froude number, Fr           |   0.15 to 0.90       |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+"
msgstr ""
"5. Fung-Leibman法による典型的抵抗データベースの標準偏差：\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"|           パラメータ        |      適用範囲        |\n"
"|-----------------------------+----------------------|\n"
"| 長さ/幅,              Lwl/B |  2.520 to 17.935     |\n"
"| 幅/喫水,                B/T |  1.696 to 10.204     |\n"
"| プリズマティック係数,    Cp |  0.526 to 0.774      |\n"
"| 中央横断面係数,          Cm |  0.556 to 0.994      |\n"
"| 水線面係数,             Cwp |  0.662 to 0.841      |\n"
"| 半入口角,                ie |    2.6 to 31.73 degr |\n"
"| トランサム面積係数,      Ta |   0.00 to 0.74       |\n"
"| トランサム幅係数,        Tw |   0.00 to 1.00       |\n"
"| DLR=V/Lwl^3                 |  16.24 to 359.2      |\n"
"| フルード数,              Fr |   0.15 to 0.90       |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+"

