#: freestringsunit.rs_resistance_oortmer_note_p1
msgctxt "freestringsunit.rs_resistance_oortmer_note_p1"
msgid ""
"1.Viscosity by default is for sea water with density 1025 kg/m^3 and temperature 15 °C.\n"
"You can change the temperature and the density: Project->Project Settings->Hydrostatics"
msgstr ""
"1. 既定の粘度は密度 1025 kg/m^3、温度 15 °C の海水に対応します。\n"
"温度と密度は「プロジェクト→プロジェクト設定→静力学」で変更できます"

#. DeepSeek Flash review note: 等宽表格：各语言列宽与分隔符需单独排版复核；Disp 单位 m3
#. 表明此处为排水体积，俄语“Водоизмещение
#. объемное”与中文“排水体积”一致，不得改为质量排水量。原文“Standart”为拼写错误，译文按“标准偏差”处理。
#: freestringsunit.rs_resistance_oortmer_note_p5
msgctxt "freestringsunit.rs_resistance_oortmer_note_p5"
msgid ""
"5.Standart deviation of database for typical resistance van Oortmerssen's method:\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"|        Parameters           |      Limitations     |\n"
"|-----------------------------+----------------------|\n"
"| Length of water line,   Lwl |      8 ... 80 m      |\n"
"| Displacement,          Disp |      5 ... 3000 m3   |\n"
"| Length/Breadth,       Lwl/B |      3 ... 6.2       |\n"
"| Breadth/Draft,          B/T |    1.9 ... 4.0       |\n"
"| Prismatic coefficient,   Cp |   0.50 ... 0.73      |\n"
"| Midship coefficient,     Cm |   0.70 ... 0.97      |\n"
"| Long.center of buoyancy,LCB |  -7% L ... 2.8% L    |\n"
"| Half entrance angle,     ie |     10 ... 46 degr   |\n"
"| Speed/length,    V/sqrt(Lwl)|      0 ... 1.79      |\n"
"| Froude number,           Fr |      0 ... 0.50      |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+"
msgstr ""
"5. van Oortmerssen 法による代表的な抵抗のデータベースの標準偏差：\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"|            パラメータ       |       適用範囲       |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"| 水線長 Lwl                  |      8 ... 80 m      |\n"
"| 排水容積 Disp               |      5 ... 3000 m3   |\n"
"| 長さ/幅 Lwl/B               |      3 ... 6.2       |\n"
"| 幅/喫水 B/T                 |    1.9 ... 4.0       |\n"
"| 柱形係数 Cp                 |   0.50 ... 0.73      |\n"
"| 中央横断面係数 Cm           |   0.70 ... 0.97      |\n"
"| 浮心縦位置 LCB              |  -7% L ... 2.8% L    |\n"
"| 半水線入射角 ie             |     10 ... 46 degr   |\n"
"| 速度/長さ V/sqrt(Lwl)       |      0 ... 1.79      |\n"
"| フルード数 Fr               |      0 ... 0.50      |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+"

#. DeepSeek Flash review note:
#. 等宽表格：各语言列宽与分隔符需单独排版复核；原文“Standart”为拼写错误，译文按“标准偏差”处理；方法名 Ridgeley-Nevitt
#. 1967 保留原文。
#: freestringsunit.rs_resistance_oortmer_note_p6
msgctxt "freestringsunit.rs_resistance_oortmer_note_p6"
msgid ""
"6.Standart deviation of database for typical resistance by Ridgeley-Nevitt 1967:\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"|         Parameters          |      Limitations     |\n"
"|-----------------------------+----------------------|\n"
"| Length/Breadth,       Lwl/B |      4 ... 5.2       |\n"
"| Prismatic coefficient,   Cp |   0.55 ... 0.70      |\n"
"| Speed/length,    V/sqrt(Lwl)|   0.70 ... 1.50      |\n"
"| Coefficient    V/(0.01*L)^3 |    200 ... 500       |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+"
msgstr ""
"6. Ridgeley-Nevitt 1967 による代表的な抵抗のデータベースの標準偏差：\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"|            パラメータ       |       適用範囲       |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"| 長さ/幅 Lwl/B               |      4 ... 5.2       |\n"
"| 柱形係数 Cp                 |   0.55 ... 0.70      |\n"
"| 速度/長さ V/sqrt(Lwl)       |   0.70 ... 1.50      |\n"
"| 係数 V/(0.01*L)^3           |    200 ... 500       |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+"

#. DeepSeek Flash review note: 源文“Standart”为拼写错误，已按标准偏差译；等宽表格各语言列宽不一致，需排版复核。
#: freestringsunit.rs_resistance_oortmer_note_p7
msgctxt "freestringsunit.rs_resistance_oortmer_note_p7"
msgid ""
"7.Standart deviation of database for typical resistance by UBC-1993 method:\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"|        Parameters           |      Limitations     |\n"
"|-----------------------------+----------------------|\n"
"| Length/Breadth,       Lwl/B |    2.6 ... 3.98      |\n"
"| Breadth/Draft,          B/T |    2.0 ... 4.23      |\n"
"| Prismatic coefficient,   Cp |   0.45 ... 0.61      |\n"
"| Midship coefficient,     Cm |  0.747 ... 0.878     |\n"
"| Coefficient      L/V^0.3333 |   3.00 ... 5.31      |\n"
"| Froude number,           Fr |   0.20 ... 0.50      |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+"
msgstr ""
"7. UBC-1993 法による代表的な抵抗データベースの標準偏差：\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"|            パラメータ       |       適用範囲       |\n"
"|-----------------------------+----------------------|\n"
"| 長さ/幅 Lwl/B               |    2.6 ... 3.98      |\n"
"| 幅/喫水 B/T                 |    2.0 ... 4.23      |\n"
"| 柱形係数 Cp                 |   0.45 ... 0.61      |\n"
"| 中央横断面係数 Cm           |  0.747 ... 0.878     |\n"
"| 係数 L/V^0.3333             |   3.00 ... 5.31      |\n"
"| フルード数 Fr               |   0.20 ... 0.50      |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+"

